<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Chemical to buy back 100 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Chemical to buy back 100 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Chemical Corp said it plans to repurchase 100 million of its shares at a total cost of 40 billion yen.</p>
<p>The buying back of its common shares, at 315 yen per share, will be conducted between July 29 and August 18, the firm said in a statement.</p>
</text>
